window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Welcome to Hollywood Lakes, where the magic begins at midlife.</b><br> <br> When Shay reopens Hollywood Lakes Inn, her biggest worry is whether the plumbing in the 200-year-old house will spring a leak. But as she readies for her first VIP guest, she's caught in flashbacks that never happened—memories so vivid she wonders if she's losing her perimenopausal mind.<br> <br> With no time to dwell, she focuses on Porter Nichols, the famous screenwriter renting the entire second floor. He's got a script to finish and a terrible case of writer's block. When an unexpected guest arrives along with some disgruntled muses, Shay suspects his problem is magical in nature. But finding the solution threatens to derail her first night with Finn.<br> <br> The deeper she delves into Porter's mystery, the more her own is revealed, and the fate of the word witch is called into question. She'll need to summon all of her power—and the ghost of her beloved grandmother—to protect the legacy of the witch.<br> <br> Hollywood Lakes Magical Midlife is a coming-of-middle-age series filled with witchy adventures, found family, and a slow-burn romance. It's a paranormal women's fiction with wit, attitude, and a heart of gold.</p>"; 
